(Q3 - Brute-Force String Matching \(6 Marks\)) Tj
50 671.0 Td
(==========================================) Tj
50 658.0 Td
(Problem: Security log screening uses brute-force pattern matching.) Tj
50 645.0 Td
() Tj
50 632.0 Td
() Tj
50 619.0 Td
(ALGORITHM: BruteForceStringMatch\(text[0..n-1], pattern[0..m-1]\)) Tj
50 606.0 Td
(----------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
50 593.0 Td
(// Search for first occurrence of pattern in text) Tj
50 580.0 Td
(// Input : Text of length n, Pattern of length m) Tj
50 567.0 Td
(// Output: Index of first match \(-1 if not found\), comparison count) Tj
50 554.0 Td
() Tj
50 541.0 Td
(  comparisons <- 0) Tj
50 528.0 Td
(  FOR i <- 0 TO n-m DO) Tj
50 515.0 Td
(      j <- 0) Tj
50 502.0 Td
(      WHILE j < m AND text[i+j] = pattern[j] DO) Tj
50 489.0 Td
(          comparisons <- comparisons + 1) Tj
50 476.0 Td
(          j <- j + 1) Tj
50 463.0 Td
(      END WHILE) Tj
50 450.0 Td
(      IF j < m THEN) Tj
50 437.0 Td
(          comparisons <- comparisons + 1   // The mismatching comparison) Tj
50 424.0 Td
(      END IF) Tj
50 411.0 Td
(      IF j = m THEN) Tj
50 398.0 Td
(          RETURN i, comparisons            // Match found at index i) Tj
50 385.0 Td
(      END IF) Tj
50 372.0 Td
(  END FOR) Tj
50 359.0 Td
(  RETURN -1, comparisons                   // Not found) Tj
50 346.0 Td
() Tj
50 333.0 Td
(Step-by-Step Logic:) Tj
50 320.0 Td
(  1. Align pattern at position i=0 in the text.) Tj
50 307.0 Td
(  2. Compare pattern[0] with text[0], pattern[1] with text[1], etc.) Tj
50 294.0 Td
(  3. If all m characters match: pattern found at index i -- return.) Tj
50 281.0 Td
(  4. If a mismatch occurs: shift pattern one position right \(i <- i+1\).) Tj
50 268.0 Td
(  5. Repeat for all valid alignment positions \(0 to n-m\).) Tj
50 255.0 Td
(  6. If no match found after all positions: return -1.) Tj
50 242.0 Td
() Tj
50 229.0 Td
() Tj
50 216.0 Td
(ENGINEERING THE BEHAVIOUR) Tj
50 203.0 Td
(==========================) Tj
50 190.0 Td
() Tj
50 177.0 Td
(  BEST CASE -- 1 comparison per alignment \(mismatch on first character\):) Tj
50 164.0 Td
(    Design: Text has NO occurrence of pattern[0]) Tj
50 151.0 Td
(    Example:) Tj
50 138.0 Td
(      Text:    "AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA"  \(n=18, all 'A'\)) Tj
50 125.0 Td
(      Pattern: "BAAAA"              \(m=5, starts with 'B'\)) Tj
50 112.0 Td
(    Result: 1 comparison per alignment, total = n-m+1 comparisons) Tj
50 99.0 Td
(    Total comparisons = n - m + 1 = O\(n\)) Tj
50 86.0 Td
() Tj
50 73.0 Td
(  WORST CASE -- m comparisons per alignment \(mismatch on last character\):) Tj
